hollows. She was born deformed and labeled as an imigo—a child touched by the corruption. It's rumored she can heal any wound and has lived for more than 500 years."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170788"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/00454c3f1e5d9a7c4da54e61b562a4f53eebe435161e9cf2add7de61760dc3a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f6946fc66a637fc9a53a9b7e69f4a2a88b791aadc7d54b853421c8149a1949d.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c88846","characterName":"与","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c88846"},"originalCharacterName":"与","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character of this story. A commoner soldier born in Migiwa, who resides in the capital city. He is a young man with a cheerful and honest personality. Although he is considered to be one of the finest fighters of Migiwa, he often only takes part in low-risk missions due to his status and age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His tsukai is a black wolf named Kotetsu."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88846"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/508a92ae432011622ae718d6cdd5cbec3268fddf5af96df41544d8031eeedca7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47c603c2120efd647614245b65dd7632a2f548164d9de4ef18d1951a45a1ea6c.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風見灰児","creatorId":"vndb:s21941","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21941","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21941","name":"風見灰児","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83297","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c88847","characterName":"長流","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c88847"},"originalCharacterName":"長流","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The second son of the king of Migiwa, considered to be his next successor. He is a young man of few words, who always keeps a firm attitude. He is loved by the people as a young, noble and intelligent person. Like Tasuku, he is said to be a hero candidate who will lead the country's next generation. As his royal duty, he and his father lead the soldiers on the front line."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His tsukai is a white heron."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88847"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c5f0b518b3874e113137d9afdfb6a34ea2d398ac72f4e9bf0f31c7b06d7c29c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c13a67bf1f020286b416288f9df485bab2ce9c0526010f5d092417622c38bdbf.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤堂ロキ","creatorId":"vndb:s21942","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21942","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21942","name":"藤堂ロキ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83298","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c88848","characterName":"ヤエル","